window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>They used me for my power. What they don't realize is that they created something more powerful than they could have ever imagined.</p> <p>We didn't escape the Lycans unscathed. Knox is hurt—physically and emotionally. My powers are gone. And Javion . . .</p> <p>My mates want me to rest and recover, but how can I do that when the ones who hurt me and my mates are still out there? The only thing that will make me feel better is revenge.</p> <p>If the Lycans want me back, they're going to get me. Because everything they've done has changed me more than anyone could ever realize . . . Deep inside me, I have the power to make things right.</p> <p>They created a being so powerful and when they find out, they're going to be shocked.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
